# TypeScript/JavaScript Testing

- Unit and integration tests run under the Bun test runner from `tests/**` (`bunfig.toml` sets
  `root = "tests"` and preloads `tests/preload.ts`).
- Run one file: `bun test tests/lib/cache.test.ts`. Run one case: `bun test -t "name"`.
- Use **Playwright** for E2E of critical user flows: `bun run test:e2e`
  (`e2e/playwright.config.ts`, needs the Astro dev server up).
